---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import LegalEntity from '../components/shared/LegalEntity.astro';
import { company } from '../data/company';

const sections = [
  { id: 'about', label: '1. About these terms' },
  { id: 'website', label: '2. Using this website' },
  { id: 'services', label: '3. Client services' },
  { id: 'products', label: '4. Our products and apps' },
  { id: 'meta', label: '5. Meta and WhatsApp rules' },
  { id: 'ip', label: '6. Intellectual property' },
  { id: 'liability', label: '7. Liability' },
  { id: 'changes', label: '8. Changes' },
  { id: 'contact', label: '9. Contact' },
];
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Terms of Service | InvigoSol"
  heading="Terms of Service"
  description="Terms for using the InvigoSol website, apps and services, including apps built on Meta's WhatsApp Business Platform and Facebook Login for Business."
  intro="These terms apply when you use the InvigoSol website or an InvigoSol app. Client projects are also governed by a separate written agreement."
  canonicalPath="/terms"
  sections={sections}
>
  <h2 id="about">1. About these terms</h2>
  <p>
    These terms are between you and {company.legalName} ("InvigoSol", "we", "us"). By using our website or apps you agree
    to them. If you use them for a business, you confirm that you can accept these terms for that business.
  </p>

  <h2 id="website">2. Using this website</h2>
  <p>
    The content on this website is for general information. Do not misuse the site, try to break its security, or copy
    its content for commercial use without our permission.
  </p>

  <h2 id="services">3. Client services</h2>
  <p>
    Consulting, development and managed services are provided under a separate proposal, statement of work or agreement.
    If that agreement conflicts with these terms, the agreement takes priority. Where we process personal data for a
    client, we do so as a processor under that client's instructions.
  </p>

  <h2 id="products">4. Our products and apps</h2>
  <p>
    Our products, including <a href="/products/bizagent">BizAgent</a>, have their own terms (for BizAgent,
    <a href="https://bizagent.pk/terms/">bizagent.pk/terms</a>), which apply in addition to these. You are responsible for
    the accounts you connect, for keeping your login details safe and for the instructions you give our apps.
  </p>

  <h2 id="meta">5. Meta and WhatsApp rules</h2>
  <p>If you connect a WhatsApp Business Account or Meta business portfolio to one of our apps, you agree to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      follow the <a href="https://business.whatsapp.com/policy">WhatsApp Business Messaging and Business Policies</a>, the
      <a href="https://www.whatsapp.com/legal/business-terms">WhatsApp Business Terms of Service</a> and Meta's
      <a href="https://www.facebook.com/legal/commercial_terms">Commercial Terms</a>;
    </li>
    <li>message only people who have given you permission to contact them on WhatsApp, and stop when they ask;</li>
    <li>use Meta-approved message templates outside the 24-hour customer service window;</li>
    <li>not send spam, prohibited content or messages that break the law;</li>
    <li>tell your customers and staff, where the law requires it, that their messages are processed by our apps.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Meta may suspend a number or account that breaks its rules. We may also suspend an app connection that puts other
    users, Meta's platform or our service at risk. Meta charges for some WhatsApp messages, and those charges are your
    responsibility unless your plan says otherwise.
  </p>

  <h2 id="ip">6. Intellectual property</h2>
  <p>
    We own our website, products and brand. Ownership of work we create for clients is set out in the client agreement.
    WhatsApp, Facebook and Meta are trademarks of Meta Platforms, Inc.; InvigoSol is not affiliated with or endorsed by Meta.
  </p>

  <h2 id="liability">7. Liability</h2>
  <p>
    The website and free resources are provided "as is". To the extent the law allows, we are not liable for indirect or
    consequential losses. Nothing in these terms limits liability that cannot be limited by law.
  </p>

  <h2 id="changes">8. Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update these terms. The date at the top shows the latest version.</p>

  <h2 id="contact">9. Contact</h2>
  <LegalEntity />
</LegalLayout>
